# AI agent modes and the harness > Design mode
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/agent-modes.md#L264
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

run::a Run the design mode ::e --> design mode ::c, writes a proposal only ::c

branch::a Open a design branch ::e
  --> propose::a Write the proposal ::e
  --> draft::a Draft the changes ::e
branch, propose, draft --::P--> run

agent::a coding agent --> branch, propose, draft
wt::a design worktree --> branch, propose, draft
prop::a proposal document --> propose
pages::a drafted pages --> draft

agent --> AI agent ::c
wt --> design workspace ::c, design branch ::c
prop --> proposal ::c, output ::c
pages --> Markdown page ::c
